    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong>Table&nbsp;16.18</strong> Lifetime cancer risks and general screening recommendations in <em>PTEN</em> hamartoma tumour syndrome</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Chella (R.S.) van der Post",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cancer </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cumulative risks (by age 60&ndash;70&nbsp;years)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Reported median patient age at cancer diagnosis</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.8pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"124\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Predominant histology</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 181.15pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"242\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Recommended screening</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Breast (female)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">54&ndash;85%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">37&ndash;48&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"124\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Invasive breast carcinoma, no special type</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 181.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"242\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Yearly MRI from 30&nbsp;years of age, mammography every 2&nbsp;years from 40&nbsp;years of age</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Thyroid</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">9&ndash;38%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">30&ndash;48&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"124\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Follicular carcinoma</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 181.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"242\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Yearly ultrasound from 18&nbsp;years of age</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Endometrial</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">22&ndash;33%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">40&ndash;60&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"124\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Endometrioid adenocarcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 181.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"242\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Not recommended; consider surveillance as part of clinical trial</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Renal cell</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">2&ndash;34%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">45&ndash;57&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"124\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Papillary</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 181.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"242\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Every 2&nbsp;years ultrasound from 40&nbsp;years of age</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Colorectal</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">3&ndash;16%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">53&ndash;64&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"124\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Adenocarcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 181.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"242\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Baseline colonoscopy from 35&ndash;40&nbsp;years of age; consider further surveillance as required by the gastroenterologist</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Melanoma skin</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">6&ndash;12%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.6pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">27&ndash;39&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.8pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"124\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Melanoma</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 181.15pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"242\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Baseline skin examination from 30&nbsp;years of age; consider further surveillance as required by the dermatologist</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Note: Cumulative lifetime risks are based on a recent large cohort (455&nbsp;patients with <em>PTEN</em> hamartoma tumour syndrome <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{36171661}</span>) and earlier datasets <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{20565722;23934601;23335809;22252256}</span>; the upper end of the range is likely ascertainment bias. The recommended screening is based on the most recent literature (European surveillance guideline <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{32533092}</span>); global variations may exist.</p>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
