    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong>Box&nbsp;16.05</strong> Diagnostic criteria for <em>PTEN</em> hamartoma tumour syndrome</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Chella (R.S.) van der Post",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGridLight\" style=\"width: 16.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; mso-border-insideh: none; mso-border-insidev: none;\" border=\"0\" width=\"605\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Major criteria:</span></em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Pathognomonic criteria</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Adult Lhermitte&ndash;Duclos disease (cerebellar tumours)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Macrocephaly</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Multiple (&ge;&nbsp;3) gastrointestinal hamartomas, including ganglioneuromas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Multiple (&ge;&nbsp;3) mucocutaneous lesions (trichilemmomas, acral keratoses, mucocutaneous neuromas, oral papillomas)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Other major criteria</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Breast cancer</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Endometrial carcinoma</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Thyroid follicular carcinoma</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Minor criteria:</span></em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 11; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Autism spectrum disorder</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 12; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Single colon hamartoma or ganglioneuroma</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 13; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Oesophageal glycogenic acanthosis</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 14; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Lipomas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 15; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Testicular lipomatosis</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 16; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Renal cell carcinoma</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 17; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Other thyroid lesions (papillary cancer, follicular adenomas, multinodular goitre)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 18; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Vascular anomalies</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 19; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Diagnostic criteria proposals <span class=\"Ref-ID\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">{21194675;24136893}</span></span> differ slightly, but they consistently require the presence of at least one pathognomonic criterion combined with at least one additional major/minor criterion.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
